  "text": "Intake note (Commercial team, 05/09/2018). Our client Meera Iyer is a 60-year-old journalist who lives at Bungalow 35, Dharampeth, Nagpur 440018 and can be reached on 61394 67542 or meera.iyer@example.in. The client's PAN KKTPI5196B.\nThe client consulted us about a cheque bounce matter against Ramesh Mishra. A cheque for 44.4 lakh rupees issued by Ramesh Mishra bounced: the drawer stopped the cheque with a stop-payment instruction.\nThe cheque was deposited in the client's account no. 675102993471 (IFSC KKBK0773640).\nThe matter was filed as S.C.C. No. 2493/2019 before the Judicial Magistrate First Class Court at Nagpur on 8 January 2019.",
